***************************************************************************************************
* ⏱️ TIME COMPLEXITY:  O(N)
* Each node is visited once. No repeated height computations.
*
* 💾 SPACE COMPLEXITY: O(H)
* Where H = height of the tree (recursion stack). 
* Worst: O(N) for skewed tree, Best: O(log N) for balanced tree.
